# Prolog, program 1 hanoi_moves (the towers of hanoi of rosetta-prolog with a moves record kept by assertz/retract): developer_05 2026-11-23, steps 13 to 26 rewritten 2026-11-24 from skill debugger section 2a and the simulator sim.py (evidence /home/resources/evidence/developer_05/hanoi-steps-2026-11-24). The expects are worked out from the program and the law of skill debugger section 2a (Prolog: a stop at a clause head after head unification and before each body goal; a variable not yet born reads _; next passes a call whole; in enters a clause the program defines; the line of a frame is its waiting call), never read off a run. Cells from 0 among the code cells, lines from 1 in the cell; frames top first as [name/arity, line]; the directive of the last cell is the root frame main.
